        dcterms:description "Validates 10 quantitative benchmarks: 374 channel videos (333.05 h), TAME goal radius collapse 91.0 -> 1.0 r_cell at G_gj=0, Chvykov Low-Rattling slope -1.0000 (r = -1.0000, 15.625x enrichment), 100% polycomputing gate accuracy, GRN single-step Delta E = -12.80 (-eta N^2), Froese optimal stopping k* = 37 (P = 0.3710 vs 1/e = 0.3679), and multicellular Prisoner's Dilemma viability k=4 / dominance k=16." ;
