    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-measurement-law-17-hoel-albantakis-causal-emergence-2-0-intensive-causal-primitive-gain-delta-cp-i-on-s-6> a schema:PropertyValue,
